  "blocks": [
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Read "
        },
        {
          "label": "01-core/",
          "section": "core",
          "t": "docref"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " first. This file adds the rules that apply only to businesses that work on people's bodies."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "d77cb98f1250cd52",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This covers hairdressing, barbering, nails, beauty therapy, lashes, massage, tattooing and piercing."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "ed6acb4157298704",
      "id": "intro.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Words used in this file"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "f8f7e4fc9c5c8540",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Words used in this file"
    },
    {
      "hash": "37f706eab9732729",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.1",
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Plain meanings for the terms used in this file. The full list is in "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Glossary"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "lookup/glossary",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The legal category for hair, beauty, massage and tattoo businesses."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Health establishment"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The municipal health inspector."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "EHP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Whether your address is allowed to be used for business."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Zoning"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Cover for when a treatment harms a client."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Treatment liability insurance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "meaning": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A small skin test before a chemical treatment. Record it."
            }
          ],
          "term": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Patch test"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "kind": "terms"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "words-used-in-this-file.2",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You need a municipal licence"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "f1179cdfad91261d",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "You need a municipal licence"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "These are health establishments under the Businesses Act."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f2756c4e7fce31e3",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The categories that typically require a municipal trading licence under the Businesses Act include health establishments: businesses providing health, beauty, or body treatment services, including hairdressers, barbers, beauty salons, nail salons, tattoo studios, and similar premises."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "1fe7ce03e8b7c5fd",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "No person may carry on certain service-related businesses unless they hold a licence issued by the council, local authority or municipality where the business premises are situated."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "e034040ed4da416e",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You may not begin trading in a business that requires a licence before the licence has been issued. Trading without a valid licence is punishable with a fine."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "0587fcf86be90a21",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Apply through your municipal Business Licensing office. An Environmental Health Practitioner will inspect the premises."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "71273b188daadc6a",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "What the inspector usually looks at: hand washing facilities, ventilation, surface cleanability, waste disposal, storage of chemicals, and separation from living space if you work from home."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "2e55e6030e8d15cf",
      "id": "you-need-a-municipal-licence.6",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Tattoo and piercing studios"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "00fb0f54df70611f",
      "id": "tattoo-and-piercing-studios",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Tattoo and piercing studios"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "These face the strictest inspection in this category, because they break the skin."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "d73730eeb9895b2f",
      "id": "tattoo-and-piercing-studios.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Expect questions about sterilisation equipment, single-use needles, sharps containers, waste removal contracts, and record keeping of clients and batch numbers."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "076abb35fa7189a9",
      "id": "tattoo-and-piercing-studios.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Talk to your Environmental Health Practitioner before you sign a lease. The premises requirements can make a cheap space unusable."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f6897a7e4c715e62",
      "id": "tattoo-and-piercing-studios.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Working from home"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "f76f2a0064715587",
      "id": "working-from-home",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Working from home"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This is common and usually legal. But you need zoning approval, and usually a separate treatment room with its own basin."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c7125a3461b05d4d",
      "id": "working-from-home.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Ask town planning about your zoning before you spend money on a room. Some residential zonings allow a home occupation with limits on client numbers, parking and signage."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "744d0f062b97af43",
      "id": "working-from-home.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you make or sell products"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "8d2dad5d0c183740",
      "id": "if-you-make-or-sell-products",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "If you make or sell products"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Selling retail products someone else manufactures is ordinary retail. See "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Retail and online shop"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "business-types/retail-online",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f86fa306d29ff135",
      "id": "if-you-make-or-sell-products.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Making your own oils, creams, scrubs or hair products changes things. The Foodstuffs, Cosmetics and Disinfectants Act 54 of 1972 regulates cosmetics, including labelling and ingredient claims."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f52dc29fa1cb37a7",
      "id": "if-you-make-or-sell-products.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Do not claim a product treats a medical condition. \"Clears eczema\" or \"cures acne\" can reclassify your product as a medicine, which brings SAHPRA into your life. \"Soothes dry skin\" is a cosmetic claim. \"Treats dermatitis\" is not."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7fc6d20459a716ea",
      "id": "if-you-make-or-sell-products.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Insurance you actually need"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "361323082b2bf9ff",
      "id": "insurance-you-actually-need",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Insurance you actually need"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Professional indemnity or treatment liability cover. One burn from a relaxer, one infected piercing, or one bad reaction to a product can cost you more than a year of profit."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "172a14364a7d0eb8",
      "id": "insurance-you-actually-need.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Ask a broker for cover appropriate to the treatments you actually perform, and tell them everything you do. Cover bought for \"hairdressing\" will not respond to a lash lift claim."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "46e864a7215232e3",
      "id": "insurance-you-actually-need.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Consumer law applies to services too"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "a4908024ea917a1d",
      "id": "consumer-law-applies-to-services-too",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Consumer law applies to services too"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A service must be performed with reasonable skill and care. If a treatment goes wrong, the customer has a right to have it put right or refunded."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "8c13d6ef3b7e6d52",
      "id": "consumer-law-applies-to-services-too.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Protect yourself with a consultation record: what the client asked for, what you advised, any allergy or patch test, and what was agreed. Have them sign it. For colour, chemical and skin treatments, a patch test record is the difference between a defensible position and a settlement."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "3241b1788313c053",
      "id": "consumer-law-applies-to-services-too.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Bookings, deposits and no-shows"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "9a1a44156a95c08c",
      "id": "bookings-deposits-and-no-shows",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Bookings, deposits and no-shows"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "No-shows are the biggest hidden cost in this industry."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "5b15286d25e88c38",
      "id": "bookings-deposits-and-no-shows.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A deposit is legal and enforceable if the terms are clear and reasonable before booking. Under the Consumer Protection Act a customer may cancel a booking. You may charge a cancellation fee, but it must be reasonable. Reasonable depends on how much notice they gave, and whether you could fill the slot with someone else."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "ca2c77fcc9c014d0",
      "id": "bookings-deposits-and-no-shows.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Put your cancellation terms in writing, send them with the booking confirmation, and apply them consistently. Terms you only mention when someone misses an appointment are hard to enforce."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "09dceee8d64c7a7c",
      "id": "bookings-deposits-and-no-shows.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Branding and marketing notes"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "cf2e2a9a2f4c9c97",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Branding and marketing notes"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Use "
        },
        {
          "label": "02-branding-and-marketing/",
          "section": "branding",
          "t": "docref"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". Two things matter more in this industry than in most:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6a0a2641dd0ff04e",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Before-and-after photos are your most effective marketing, but you need permission. Ask every client, in writing, before posting their face. This is a POPIA requirement as well as basic courtesy. Keep the permission on file."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "1e93d6317b589dc0",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Google Business Profile reviews drive local bookings more than any social post. Ask every happy client. See "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Marketing prompts"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "branding/marketing-prompts",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "a2701504475bcfb3",
      "id": "branding-and-marketing-notes.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
